<!--
  The notification small icon: the app's own mark, scaled down from the launcher foreground.

  A small icon is an alpha mask — the system throws the colours away and repaints the
  silhouette, white in the status bar and tinted by setColor in the shade — so this is a
  stroke on transparency and the colour below is only a convention.

  The cream dot the full mark carries at the trough is dropped. At 24dp it would be about as
  wide as the stroke it sits in, so as a hole it closes up and as a fill it reads as a nick.
  Simplifying at small sizes is what notification icons are for.
-->
